"Risk of Rain is an arcade style action platformer. You control different characters and traverse the landscapes of foreign planets in search of teleporters to other planets. The game has local and online co-op (hosted from your's or your friend's IP).\n\nTo put it bluntly, the game is tons of fun. It's got that classic arcade feel of wanting to get better and being addicting as hell, but without draining the quarters from your pocket. It feels great making progress in this game because for the most part it is skill based and it's rare I've found that the game will really dupe you with bad luck. This game is worth every cent I paid for it so far and I plan to sink more hours into it.\n\n8/10", "timestamp_created": 1399479090, "timestamp_updated": 1399479090, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10044673", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041325924", "personaname": "Dangerous Lee", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/basedsaiyan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1729, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 517, "last_played": 1656909200, "avatar": "47ce49fa6cd7abdf1741407c14b87a50d7cf2fa6"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is great fun, and addictive! I love to pay this even though i havent completed this it is much fun for me!", "timestamp_created": 1399476279, "timestamp_updated": 1399476279, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}